{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393760/extras/4ab522a57bc47e223e4ef9e219e1cfd7.avif?t=1752943486\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tall Trails</strong> is a chill exploration game, where every item can be used as fuel in your Rocket Boot to blast yourself into the air! You're Alp, a little golem on a quest to find his purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blast off with your Rocket Boot!</strong> Use items as fuel in your Rocket Boot to blast yourself upwards! Each item has different powers: jet pack with hot peppers, hover with whirligigs, or swing on webs with spiders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393760/extras/item-usage.gif?t=1752943486\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a weird &amp; wonderful world! </strong> Summit mountains, help out at camp, and search for treasure. Traverse 5 unique biomes, each full of new and exciting ways to move and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find your purpose in life!</strong> Every golem has a purpose\u2026 but not you? What's up with that??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your look &amp; build!</strong> Find &amp; upgrade powerful badges to increase your platforming abilities to unreasonable levels! Or just focus on collecting hats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tons of Replayability!</strong> Once you're done with the main story, start your adventure anew in a randomly generated world. Explore islands no one else has seen before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tall Trails features accessibility options including full controller support, flexible difficulty settings, and input remapping. The story runs ~4 hours, with many more hours of exploring randomly generated worlds available afterwards!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2393760?t=1752943486","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393760/dec5eef2f495fa0798973bc4a4daf37bdaf24df3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752943486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393760/7e51babcf93d1dc63a3b7c2e9db178b040c9ad55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752943486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393760/7e51babcf93d1dc63a3b7c2e9db178b040c9ad55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752943486","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3028520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393760/extras/4ab522a57bc47e223e4ef9e219e1cfd7.avif?t=1752943486\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tall Trails</strong> is a chill exploration game, where every item can be used as fuel in your Rocket Boot to blast yourself into the air! You're Alp, a little golem on a quest to find his purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Blast off with your Rocket Boot!</strong> Use items as fuel in your Rocket Boot to blast yourself upwards! Each item has different powers: jet pack with hot peppers, hover with whirligigs, or swing on webs with spiders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393760/extras/item-usage.gif?t=1752943486\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a weird &amp; wonderful world! </strong> Summit mountains, help out at camp, and search for treasure. Traverse 5 unique biomes, each full of new and exciting ways to move and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find your purpose in life!</strong> Every golem has a purpose\u2026 but not you? What's up with that??</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your look &amp; build!</strong> Find &amp; upgrade powerful badges to increase your platforming abilities to unreasonable levels! Or just focus on collecting hats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tons of Replayability!</strong> Once you're done with the main story, start your adventure anew in a randomly generated world. Explore islands no one else has seen before!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tall Trails features accessibility options including full controller support, flexible difficulty settings, and input remapping. The story runs ~4 hours, with many more hours of exploring randomly generated worlds available afterwards!</p>","developers":["Brady Soglin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393760/0a4b1e6